<div id="host-stats" class="contents">
  <% metrics.each do |value, icon, tooltip| %>
    <%#
      A hover label for the pointer: the reading itself is on the screen, and
      the tooltip only says what it counts. The sr-only element carries the
      reading and the words together, because a reading without them says
      nothing on its own. The chip is hidden from a screen reader so that the
      two are said once (see daisyui.css).
    %>

    <span
      class="tooltip tooltip-bottom tooltip-info inline-flex items-center gap-1 whitespace-nowrap before:font-sans <%= value_class(value) %>"
      data-tip="<%= tooltip %>"
      aria-hidden="true"
    >
      <i class="<%= icon %>"></i>
      <%= value_text(value) %>
    </span>

    <span class="sr-only"><%= value_text(value) %> <%= tooltip %></span>
  <% end %>
</div>
